Vendored as the git submodule at reference/xolsh, from the fork at
https://github.com/WhiteLicorice/xolsh. The fork differs from upstream in one
commit, which deletes .gitmodules and its three gitlinks: one of them uses an
SSH URL, which makes a recursive clone of this repository fail for anyone
without a key on that host.

No other change was made to it. The pipeline stages in reference/driver are a
separate package that imports xolsh as a library, so xolsh's own source stays
exactly as its author wrote it.

