Most of the files under reference/tests/lab3, lab4, and lab5 started life in
that corpus. They were bucketed by feature, filtered down to what this course
actually covers, and rewritten into this harness's annotation vocabulary by
reference/tools/adapt_corpus.py, which documents each transformation. Every
resulting expectation was then checked against the built reference rather than
trusted from upstream.

